  "html": "<div class=\"lp-container\">\n    <!-- ---------------------------------------- ÁREA PARA COLOCAR STYLES ----------------------------------------------------------- -->\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/style-faq-padrao.css\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/style-html-padrao.css\">\n\n\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        .video-header,\n        .video-header * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        .video-header {\n            --badge-size: 8rem;\n            --banner-height: 250px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            width: 100%;\n            position: relative;\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n            container-type: inline-size;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__banner {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: var(--banner-height);\n            position: relative;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__banner-video {\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__badge {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: calc(var(--badge-size) / -2);\n            width: var(--badge-size);\n            height: var(--badge-size);\n            background-color: #ff9900;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__badge-img {\n            max-width: 90px;\n            max-height: 90px;\n            object-fit: contain;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__body {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: calc(var(--badge-size) / 2 + 1.1rem) 0.3rem .8rem;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__brand {\n            color: #ff9900;\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__title {\n            color: #000;\n            font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);\n            line-height: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 3.1rem);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            max-width: 50rem;\n            text-wrap: pretty;\n        }\n\n        .video-header__subtitle {\n            color: #8a8a8a;\n            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);\n            line-height: 120%;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n            max-width: 52rem;\n            text-wrap: pretty;\n        }\n\n        @media (prefers-contrast: more) {\n            .video-header__subtitle {\n                color: #000;\n            }\n\n            .video-header__brand {\n                color: #3a2301;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .video-header {\n                --banner-height: 180px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 470px) {\n            .video-header__subtitle {\n\n                font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);\n                font-weight: 550;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <style>\n        .section-28 {\n            --s8-color-brand: #e76e37;\n            --s8-color-ink: #081844;\n            --s8-color-muted: #5b6682;\n            --s8-color-soft: #dfeaff;\n            --s8-color-line: #e76e37;\n            --s8-color-surface: #ffffff;\n\n            width: 100%;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 0 1rem 1.5rem;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\n            color: var(--s8-color-ink);\n            overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n        }\n\n        .section-28,\n        .section-28 * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__title-accessible {\n            width: 1px;\n            height: 1px;\n            position: absolute;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            clip-path: inset(50%);\n            white-space: nowrap;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__inner {\n            width: 100%;\n            min-width: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: stretch;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            padding: 1rem;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(8, 24, 68, 0.08);\n            border-radius: 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--s8-color-surface);\n            box-shadow: 0 1rem 2.5rem rgba(3, 33, 82, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .section-28__tabs {\n            width: 100%;\n            min-width: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n            align-items: stretch;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            order: 1;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__option {\n            min-width: 0;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__control {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 1px;\n            height: 1px;\n            opacity: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__tab {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            min-height: 3.5rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 0.875rem 0.75rem;\n            border: 1px solid var(--s8-color-line);\n            border-radius: 999px;\n            background: var(--s8-color-surface);\n            color: var(--s8-color-brand);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition:\n                background-color 240ms ease,\n                border-color 240ms ease,\n                color 240ms ease,\n                transform 240ms ease;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__control:focus-visible+.section-28__tab {\n            outline: 0.125rem solid var(--s8-color-brand);\n            outline-offset: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__tab-icon {\n            width: 1.5rem;\n            height: 1.5rem;\n            flex: 0 0 1.5rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__tab-icon-svg {\n            width: 1.5rem;\n            height: 1.5rem;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__tab-text {\n            min-width: 0;\n            color: currentColor;\n            font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 2.8vw, 0.9375rem);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n            text-align: center;\n            overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__viewport {\n            width: 100%;\n            min-width: 0;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border-radius: 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--s8-color-surface);\n        }\n\n        /*\n             * Os painéis inativos ficam absolutos para não interferirem\n             * na altura do painel atualmente selecionado.\n             */\n        .section-28__panel {\n            width: 100%;\n            min-width: 0;\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: stretch;\n            opacity: 0;\n            visibility: hidden;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            transform: translateX(1rem);\n            transition:\n                opacity 320ms ease,\n                transform 320ms ease,\n                visibility 0s linear 320ms;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__figure {\n            width: 100%;\n            aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;\n            margin: 0;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border-radius: 1.5rem 1.5rem 0 0;\n            background: var(--s8-color-soft);\n        }\n\n        .section-28__figure picture {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__image {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            display: block;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            object-position: center;\n        }\n\n        /* MOBILE: caixa abaixo da imagem */\n        .section-28__content {\n            width: 100%;\n            min-width: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            border: 1px solid var(--s8-color-line);\n            border-top: 0;\n            border-radius: 0 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--s8-color-surface);\n            overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__title {\n            margin: 0;\n            color: var(--s8-color-ink);\n            font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 1.75rem);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n            text-wrap: balance;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__rule {\n            width: 3rem;\n            height: 0.125rem;\n            flex: 0 0 auto;\n            margin: 1rem 0;\n            border-radius: 999px;\n            background: var(--s8-color-brand);\n        }\n\n        .section-28__copy {\n            margin: 0;\n            color: var(--s8-color-muted);\n            font-size: clamp(0.875rem, 3.5vw, 1rem);\n            font-weight: 400;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n            text-wrap: pretty;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__dots {\n            width: 100%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-28__dot {\n            width: 1rem;\n            height: 1rem;\n            flex: 0 0 1rem;\n            border: 1px solid var(--s8-color-brand);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: var(--s8-color-surface);\n            transition:\n                background-color 240ms ease,\n                transform 240ms ease;\n        }\n\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--protection:checked) .section-28__tab--protection,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--care:checked) .section-28__tab--care,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--fragrance:checked) .section-28__tab--fragrance,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--application:checked) .section-28__tab--application {\n            border-color: var(--s8-color-brand);\n            background: var(--s8-color-brand);\n            color: var(--s8-color-surface);\n            transform: translateY(-0.25rem);\n        }\n\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--protection:checked) .section-28__panel--protection,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--care:checked) .section-28__panel--care,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--fragrance:checked) .section-28__panel--fragrance,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--application:checked) .section-28__panel--application {\n            position: relative;\n            inset: auto;\n            opacity: 1;\n            visibility: visible;\n            pointer-events: auto;\n            transform: translateX(0);\n            transition-delay: 0s;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--protection:checked) .section-28__dot--protection,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--care:checked) .section-28__dot--care,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--fragrance:checked) .section-28__dot--fragrance,\n        .section-28:has(.section-28__control--application:checked) .section-28__dot--application {\n            background: var(--s8-color-brand);\n            transform: scale(1.25);\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 420px) {\n            .section-28 {\n                padding-inline: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__inner {\n                padding: 0.75rem;\n                border-radius: 1.25rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__tabs {\n                gap: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__tab {\n                min-height: 3.25rem;\n                padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__content {\n                padding: 1.25rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 576px) {\n            .section-28 {\n                padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__inner {\n                padding: 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__content {\n                padding: 2rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__tab-text {\n                font-size: clamp(0.875rem, 2vw, 1rem);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 768px) {\n            .section-28 {\n                padding: 0 2rem 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__inner {\n                gap: 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__figure {\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 650px;\n                min-height: 650px;\n                max-height: 650px;\n                aspect-ratio: auto;\n                border-radius: 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__figure picture,\n            .section-28__image {\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 650px;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__panel {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            /* DESKTOP: caixa totalmente contida dentro da imagem */\n            .section-28__content {\n                width: min(40%, 28rem);\n                max-height: calc(100% - 2rem);\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 50%;\n                overflow: auto;\n                padding: 1.5rem;\n                border: 1px solid var(--s8-color-line);\n                border-radius: 1.5rem;\n                background: var(--s8-color-surface);\n                box-shadow: 0 1rem 2.5rem rgba(3, 33, 82, 0.16);\n                transform: translateY(-50%);\n            }\n\n            .section-28__title {\n                font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n            }\n\n            .section-28__copy {\n                font-size: clamp(0.875rem, 1.5vw, 1rem);\n            }\n\n            /* POSICIONAMENTO INDEPENDENTE DE CADA CAIXA */\n            .section-28__panel--protection .section-28__content {\n                left: 5%;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__panel--care .section-28__content {\n                right: 5%;\n                left: auto;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 992px) {\n            .section-28 {\n                padding: 0 2.5rem 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__content {\n                width: min(36%, 28rem);\n                max-height: calc(100% - 3rem);\n                padding: 2rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 1200px) {\n            .section-28 {\n                padding: 0 3rem 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-28__content {\n                width: min(34%, 28rem);\n                max-height: calc(100% - 4rem);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 1400px) {\n            .section-28 {\n                padding: 0 3rem 1.5rem;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n    <!-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- -->\n    <article class=\"pdp\" id=\"pdp\" aria-label=\"Conteúdo rico do Sérum Dove Hidratante Corporal Niacinamida 245 ml\">\n        <!-- HTML fica dentro dessa diiiiiiiiiiv PDP -->\n\n        <section class=\"video-header\">\n            <div class=\"video-header__banner\">\n                <video class=\"video-header__banner-video\"\n                    poster=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/header-dove.webp\" preload=\"none\"\n                    autoplay muted loop playsinline width=\"1200\" height=\"250\">\n                    <source src=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/header-dove.webm\">\n                </video>\n                <div class=\"video-header__badge\">\n                    <img class=\"video-header__badge-img\"\n                        src=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/logo-dove.webp\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"video-header__body\">\n                <small class=\"video-header__brand\">dove</small>\n                <h2 class=\"video-header__title\">\n                    Sérum Hidratante Corporal Niacinamida 245ml\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"video-header__subtitle\">\n                    Hidratação regenerativa por até 48 horas com niacinamida, colágeno vegano, vitamina C e óleo de rosa\n                    mosqueta.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section-28\" aria-labelledby=\"section-8-title\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-28__title-accessible\" id=\"section-8-title\">\n                Benefícios do Sérum Dove Hidratante Corporal Niacinamida\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"section-28__inner\">\n                <div class=\"section-28__tabs\" role=\"radiogroup\"\n                    aria-label=\"Benefícios do Sérum Dove Hidratante Corporal Niacinamida\">\n                    <div class=\"section-28__option\">\n                        <input class=\"section-28__control section-28__control--protection\"\n                            id=\"section-8-control-protection\" type=\"radio\" name=\"section-8-tabs\" checked>\n                        <label class=\"section-28__tab section-28__tab--protection\" for=\"section-8-control-protection\">\n                            <span class=\"section-28__tab-text\">Hidratação 48h</span>\n                        </label>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"section-28__option\">\n                        <input class=\"section-28__control section-28__control--care\" id=\"section-8-control-care\"\n                            type=\"radio\" name=\"section-8-tabs\">\n                        <label class=\"section-28__tab section-28__tab--care\" for=\"section-8-control-care\">\n                            <span class=\"section-28__tab-text\">Tom uniforme</span>\n                        </label>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"section-28__viewport\">\n                    <div class=\"section-28__panel section-28__panel--protection\">\n                        <figure class=\"section-28__figure\">\n                            <picture>\n                                <source media=\"(max-width: 768px)\"\n                                    srcset=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/serum-corporal-dove-niacinamida-245ml-frontal-cenario-dourado-toalha-208519-01-02.webp\">\n                                <img class=\"section-28__image\" width=\"1600\" height=\"650\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"\n                                    src=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/serum-corporal-dove-niacinamida-245ml-cenario-dourado-toalha-208519-01-01.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Sérum corporal Dove Niacinamida 245ml à direita, cenário claro com aro dourado, pedra e toalha branca\">\n                            </picture>\n                        </figure>\n                        <div class=\"section-28__content\">\n                            <h3 class=\"section-28__title\">\n                                Hidratação regenerativa\n                            </h3>\n                            <span class=\"section-28__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                            <p class=\"section-28__copy\">\n                                A fórmula leve ajuda a manter a pele hidratada e perfumada, com hidratação regenerativa\n                                por até 48 horas.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"section-28__panel section-28__panel--care\">\n                        <figure class=\"section-28__figure\">\n                            <picture>\n                                <source media=\"(max-width: 768px)\"\n                                    srcset=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/serum-corporal-dove-niacinamida-245ml-ambientado-laranja-flor-pedestal-208519-02-02.webp\">\n                                <img class=\"section-28__image\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"\n                                    src=\"https://imgprd.martinsatacado.com.br/catalogoimg/catalogo/serum-corporal-dove-niacinamida-245ml-ambientado-laranja-flor-208519-02-01.webp\"\n                                    alt=\"Sérum corporal Dove Niacinamida 245ml à esquerda, cenário iluminado com laranja, flor rosa e esferas douradas\">\n                            </picture>\n                        </figure>\n                        <div class=\"section-28__content\">\n                            <h3 class=\"section-28__title\">\n                                Ajuda a uniformizar o tom da pele\n                            </h3>\n                            <span class=\"section-28__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                            <p class=\"section-28__copy\">\n                                Vitamina C e óleo de rosa mosqueta ajudam a uniformizar o tom, enquanto a fórmula reduz\n                                a aparência de marcas escurecidas.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"section-28__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <span class=\"section-28__dot section-28__dot--protection\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"section-28__dot section-28__dot--care\"></span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <p style=\"color: #8a8a8a; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem); text-wrap: pretty;\n            text-align: center; padding: 30px 0;\">\n            IMAGENS MERAMENTE ILUSTRATIVAS\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Área de FAQ -->\n        <section id=\"faq-section\" aria-label=\"faq-section__title\">\n            <div id=\"faq-section__header\">\n                <h2 id=\"faq-section__title\">Dúvidas Frequentes</h2>\n            </div>\n            <ul id=\"faq-section__list\" role=\"list\">\n\n                <li id=\"faq-section__item\">\n                    <details id=\"faq-section__details\">\n                        <summary id=\"faq-section__summary\">\n                            <h3 id=\"faq-section__q-text\">O sérum ajuda a uniformizar o tom da pele?</h3>\n                            <span id=\"faq-section__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        </summary>\n\n                        <div id=\"faq-section__a-inner\">\n                            <p id=\"faq-section__a-text\">Sim. A fórmula ajuda a uniformizar o tom e reduzir a aparência\n                                de marcas escurecidas, além de auxiliar na restauração do tom natural e da luminosidade\n                                da pele.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </li>\n\n\n                <li id=\"faq-section__item\">\n                    <details id=\"faq-section__details\">\n                        <summary id=\"faq-section__summary\">\n                            <h3 id=\"faq-section__q-text\">O produto contém niacinamida?</h3>\n                            <span id=\"faq-section__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        </summary>\n\n                        <div id=\"faq-section__a-inner\">\n                            <p id=\"faq-section__a-text\">Sim. A composição apresenta Niacinamide, ingrediente que integra\n                                a fórmula do sérum corporal desenvolvido para ajudar a uniformizar o tom da pele e\n                                amenizar a aparência de marcas escurecidas.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </li>\n\n\n                <li id=\"faq-section__item\">\n                    <details id=\"faq-section__details\">\n                        <summary id=\"faq-section__summary\">\n                            <h3 id=\"faq-section__q-text\">O sérum ajuda na firmeza da pele?</h3>\n                            <span id=\"faq-section__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        </summary>\n\n                        <div id=\"faq-section__a-inner\">\n                            <p id=\"faq-section__a-text\">Sim. O produto promove firmeza, sustentação e resistência à\n                                pele, além de contribuir para a restauração da luminosidade e do tom natural.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </li>\n\n\n                <li id=\"faq-section__item\">\n                    <details id=\"faq-section__details\">\n                        <summary id=\"faq-section__summary\">\n                            <h3 id=\"faq-section__q-text\">Como é a textura do sérum corporal?</h3>\n                            <span id=\"faq-section__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        </summary>\n\n                        <div id=\"faq-section__a-inner\">\n                            <p id=\"faq-section__a-text\">A fórmula é leve e possui fácil aplicação, características que\n                                tornam o uso prático durante a rotina de cuidados corporais.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n    </article>\n</div>",
